  "title": "Garlic Shrimp Pasta",
  "description": "Use your microwave to make a butter and garlic sauce to coat tender strands of vermicelli and cooked shrimp. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese and you have a quick and delicious main dish or appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Lisa"
  ],
